;
; How Sealwax files one field of a form in MYRA (sealwax_rules.h SR6): the
; form's number and the field's place in it, its kind (1 text, 2 amount,
; 3 number), whether it is required, its bounds (characters for text,
; minor units for an amount, the value for a number) and the length of
; what was entered, in characters.
^ZXSEALWAX(form:i9, field:i2) = kind:i1! ^ required:i1! ^ lo:i15! ^ hi:i15! ^ len:i3!
